em><title>乱星海 海岛求生（17）</title><description>荒野别墅，终已落成。大潮将至，风浪起时，便是收获之时&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116169319121289&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/462ae3b7201d0921567408566c7e78a33f9af557.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A1PKzDEyF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A1PKzDEyF</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（16）</title><description>海边寻野充饥，仙人掌果解饿，我的临海小墅初见雏形&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116157776398001&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ca67eabac1098c9463a449ab17c070b70365b807.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17aP5zaE3F</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17aP5zaE3F</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>今岁立志拍视频二百，将启新程，海岛影像烦友代发，望诸君多帮助。回评嬉乐，切勿相攻。</title><description>即将离开，兄弟们再见。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116151719890130&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/34edfef61ce44d395d59c00b096857f06b73c474.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MHAqzyET3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MHAqzyET3</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（15）</title><description>仓廪尚足，潮汐未平。且修茅舍，偷得浮生半日闲。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116146367889775&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c5178a9c49f7ff22c224500cb9f4e4e299ae9a0d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1muAbzSEG9</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1muAbzSEG9</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（14）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（14）环境摸清，地势尽熟。斩获足量碳水补给，生存根基已然筑牢。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116134959384565&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/906a235f7cdd0e302f997437121ff99819a37b41.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DcfiBeEQh</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DcfiBeEQh</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（13）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（13）未中沙蟹，山中挖牛。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116123282440396&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0446290a58dc0b5ba0c0b3df860da3c0c5118356.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mWfyBDEHB</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mWfyBDEHB</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（12）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（12）不持天恩凭己功&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116111404171374&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1795d31015a068f1174e47f8146e7e6cac706af7.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MJZfBoEeX</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MJZfBoEeX</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（11）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（11）换岛新收获，海中海味鲜。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116100868145420&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/58de2229a65b734d121acd97c0e82dd952ed7621.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yLZrBiE9t</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yLZrBiE9t</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（10）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（10）新岛枯水季，环岛寻水难。终见山泉水，选择扎营地。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116089778341633&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c7f2eadd6232d2089394a3d148c6707bd029212f.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WqZQBwEWs</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WqZQBwEWs</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（9）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（9）除夕加长版：除夕辞旧岁，造舟渡沧海，丙午腾骏马，万里皆坦途。祝大家除夕团圆，马年鸿运。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116077883295384&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/297b6e312289bdd05d48bb070c0c0f2f200cd760.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1giZABBEwL</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1giZABBEwL</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（8)</title><description>海岛求生三十天（8）屯粮蓄水，勘察材料，准备造船，渡海求生。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116066709733508&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b2d1347d0e8fd8de973168d87ce2650e9b2bd25a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UFcWzeESt</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UFcWzeESt</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（7）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（7）·野藤取水｜规划换岛，晚霞下的漂亮饭真香.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116055653484491&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b0104b9dbaff338ea395b916d3451dfb9f446719.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aGcezKErn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aGcezKErn</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（6）</title><description>海岛求生三十天（6）&amp;nbsp;水尽环岛探新泉，青口充饥赏落日。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116044731515062&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/828af0e45350e7886031cd7f645002c97d7d6d2d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FoFSztEZH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FoFSztEZH</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（5）</title><description>海岛求生第五天，夜半惊醒退大潮，摸黑赶海收货丰。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116032870024816&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/47d7fd795a3e049b843a84e0746bad076caf4d50.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oEFfz5EfH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oEFfz5EfH</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（4）</title><description>乱星海 海岛求生三十天（4）水火兼备，食物有踪，求生新篇章。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116021713177546&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1ad0ce5ec1e335df27bef5d1bf9816deb8b66920.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FqFzzhEkW</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FqFzzhEkW</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（3）</title><description>乱星海 海岛求生三十天（3）守本真者，不可失审慎。爱未知者，不可忘敬畏.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116010573171682&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8d0ba63a791f753ef6e76a869fb7d2170db360c1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1D7fdBsEhf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1D7fdBsEhf</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（2）</title><description>山穷水尽疑无路，柳暗花明又一村。缺水海岛三十天艰难求生第2天（2）&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115999080712056&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/56b8554c81e35b6ae6888fd3639d60014e538b97.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mfFAzzEGJ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mfFAzzEGJ</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Feb 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>乱星海求生（1）初登海岛</title><description>全新的海岛求生挑战正式开启，跟着我，一起解锁这片海域的生存法则！点赞，投币，谢谢大家。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115987336662065&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bc6a76c6aca7e3e74f3aa6c9f732fdb0b3973024.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aE6kBrEY5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aE6kBrEY5</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>海岛求生番外篇，兑现牛大力</title><description>牛大力兑现，新友告别宴。1月17号晚9点，锁定B站播播间送牛大力，之后回湖南，剪辑海岛求生。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115904507543974&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cbb00cbef5525de18e92066a24c929cf5017fdc6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1z9rrBQEsB</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1z9rrBQEsB</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 11:27:27 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>邀友挖牛，赠诸君。</title><description>承蒙厚爱。邀友掘牛大力，赠诸君，虽劳不悔。想要野生牛大力评论区扣1，后续抽。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115892511835451&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autop